OL,3,GNEWSANorwegian teen 'hitman' detained
OL,4,Afor UK murder plot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who travelled from Norway to
OL,7,Fthe UK to carry out a "hit" for an
OL,8,Forganised crime group has been
OL,9,Fsentenced to 20 years detention.
OL,11,FJohannes Natland, 19, was arrested in a
OL,12,Fhotel room in Huddersfield, West
OL,13,FYorkshire, with two working guns and 19
OL,14,Frounds of live ammunition in March
OL,15,F2025, the Old Bailey previously heard.
OL,17,FDuring his retrial, a jury heard the
OL,18,Fteen was "recruited" by the Foxtrot
OL,19,FNetwork, which was described as a
OL,20,FSwedish organised crime group backed by
OL,21,Fthe Iranian regime.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
